Homepage: https://evox.invalid/
Description: EVOX KVM DISPOSABLE - disposable KVM VMs for e-mail and web
 EVOX KVM DISPOSABLE starts one-time KVM virtual machines from a
 protected copy of a user-maintained template (TEMPLATE-*). Each VM
 (DISPOSABLE-<PURPOSE>-NN) gets an encrypted overlay with an ephemeral
 key; stopping a VM destroys it. Guest traffic is confined by an
 nftables table, policy routing rules and a libvirt nwfilter, watched by
 a fail-closed guard service.
